y cool  someone not shown also lets marco know  he made the right choice  marco liked odin so it makes sense that  he'd want to help those carrying out his  will  but he also mentions that word of wano  never made it to sea  thus we have a possible excuse for some  people not showing up that might have  otherwise shown up  still though if marco could figure out  about it there's a chance that others  could  and i feel like shanks would be in the  same boat as marco  he liked odin too and he definitely want  to help carry out his will  not to mention the fact that his straw  hat successor luffy is present the boy  he sacrificed his arm to save before  come on shanks i need to see you in wano  bro we jump to dengiro  who under the disguise of kyoshiro runs  into sasaki as far as we know one of the  strongest of the flying six  denjiro not only figures out that  they're looking for kaido's son  he also manages to chain up sasaki  rendering him unable to battle  he thus took out a very powerful  opponent with minimum effort  and that in epic fashion shows off his  odin tattoo on his back  danger continues to be an mvp in this  arc  although i feel like if this wasn't  shonan he would have killed sasuke  rather than just  gagging him leaving someone as  troublesome as sasuke alive  seems unlikely when you're in the middle  of such a huge war  that you've been planning for for  decades we're told that the metaphoric  noose tightens around kaido's neck  as the forces surround him from all  directions we get an epic panel of  dangerous face  things look like they're going real well  but we must remember that every noose  that tightened around kaido's neck in  the past  snapped so it definitely won't be easy  for a dude especially now  that they know our samurai and pirates  are coming and that they have arguably  the most important figure of this war  momonosuke as a hostage we jump to big  mom and chopper who made eye contact  last chapter i wasn't sure which way  this would go  would big mom's head damage lead her to  recognize chopper as a friend or with  all her memories back would she  recognize him as an enemy well we got  our answer here chopper and usop got a  direct hit on her but it only irritates  the yonko she recognizes them as straw  hats  and tells them that she wants their  captain's head like the rest of her  family she wants to wipe out luffy and  restore  any injury that he did to her crew's  reputation  although scared of the yonko chopper and  usop succeed in leading her in the  opposite direction  allowing the samurai to carry out their  plans it never fails to impress me how  you can always count on ulstop when the  chips are down no matter how scared he  gets  and that pretty much applies to chopper  as well in the meantime  nami's group runs into prometheus who  recognizes nami as the woman who stole  zeus he's hot and angry while nami staff  with zeus  shakes nami is scared and this could go  either way at this point  will nami lose zeus i hope not or will  she somehow gain prometheus too  who would benefit her greatly with her  climate focused powers  that would make nami quite a force to be  reckoned with especially compared to  where she started from we then get  another cute moment with ulti  and page one ulti is acting like their  boyfriend and girlfriend while page one  just wants to get her off his back  ironically not only does she not leave  him alone she actually jumps on his back  asking for a piggyback ride it's  hilarious how page one falls straight on  his face  and he falls right in front of luffy  ulti and luffy make eye contact and thus  the two ruffians meet ulti with a  serious face  asks luffy what he wants and luffy with  a serious face  responds that he was gonna ask her the  same thing this moment really emphasizes  how similar these two  are both always speak their mind  completely ignoring societal  expectations  and common sense as well finally luffy  has met up with some flying six  opponents  and will hopefully get a real fight in  the next chapter we got the short apu  scuffle  but nothing really prolonged now next  chapter  we may get to see ulti's true powers and  we may get to see luffy really go at it  or at least he may leave them for zorro  or killer  with big mom chasing straw hats marco  and the rest making their way  to their destinations orochi about to  kill momonosuke  and kaido's son about to be found things  are probably going to get  real crazy in the next few chapters and  i can't wait  let me know what you're looking forward  to the most in the next few chapters  if you did enjoy this review and want to  keep them coming the best thing you can  do is show one piece some love by  smashing that like button and sharing  this video let's see if we can get  something epic like 5 000 likes on this  one  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell or you will miss future one piece  videos  yesterday i dropped an all paramecia  fruits in their powers explained video  so you can check that out while you wait  for the next chapter  link in the description i'll also link  my entire one piece playlist below if  you want to see videos about the yonko  warlord supernova and more as always  feel free to leave suggestions for  future one-piece videos  you would like to see in the comments  below lastly the youtube ad rates have  significantly  dropped recently so the help and support  we're getting from our anime opera  patrons is now more important than ever  a very special thank you goes out to our  patrons over on patreon who help us  survive these youtube issues and who  help make videos like this one possible  first and foremost i want to thank the  legend acknowledged by lord tuigo  himself effort a  and the one tier patrons the ones who  stand atop all clans  steven and grata alola and autumn the  world steelers acquire respect but they  have a jonathan king  desi d brandon of isles papa smurf